\section{Introduction}\label{sec:notation-intro}

This chapter serves as a quick reference for the notation used throughout the book. It collects the symbols, conventions, and abbreviations used in logic, type theory, category theory, semantics, abstract interpretation, and compiler design. The reader can consult this chapter when encountering unfamiliar notation.

