$\mathrm{CE}$ & Cut elimination & Every proof has a cut-free form \\
$\mathrm{Sub}(\Pi)$ & Subformula property & Formulas in $\Pi$ are subformulas of end-sequent \\
\hline
\end{tabular}
\end{table}

